  "caption": "U 800 dollar oldi va milliardlarni boy berdi 😳\n\n1976-yil 1-aprelda Apple’ni uch kishi ochgan: Steve Jobs, Steve Wozniak va Ronald Wayne. Wayne 10% ulush olgan va Apple’ning ilk logotipini ham o‘zi chizgan.\n\n12 kundan keyin u qarz xavfidan qo‘rqib chiqib ketdi va ulushini 800 dollarga qaytardi (keyinroq yana 1 500 dollar olgan).\n\nBugun Apple qiymati 5 trillion dollardan oshdi. 1994-yilda Wayne shartnoma qog‘ozini ham bir necha ming dollarga sotgan, 2011-yilda esa o‘sha hujjatlar Sotheby’s auksionida 1,59 million dollarga sotildi.\n\nUlushingiz — eng qimmat narsangiz. Siz o‘rnida nima qilardingiz? Izohda yozing 👇\n\nRU: В 1976 году третий основатель Apple продал свои 10% за $800. Сегодня Apple стоит больше $5 трлн.\n\nManbalar: Fortune, KQED, Wikipedia.\nFotolar (Wikimedia Commons): Ronald Wayne — Aljawad, CC BY-SA 3.0; garaj — Mathieu Thouvenin, CC BY-SA 2.0; Apple-1 — The wub, CC BY-SA 4.0; Apple Park — Daniel L. Lu va Dicklyon, CC BY-SA 4.0; Toshkent City — Medinabegim, CC BY-SA 4.0; Jobs, Wozniak (Homestead High School), ilk logotip va 100 dollar — jamoat mulki.\n\n🚀 Loyihangizga sarmoya toping yoki sarmoya kiritish uchun loyiha tanlang: investage.uz (havola profilda)\n\n#apple #biznes #startap #startup #investitsiya #investor #ulush #tarix #uzbekistan #toshkent #investage",
